.SH "نام (NAME)"
kmymoney \- the personal finances manager by KDE
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBkmymoney\fR\ 'u
\fBkmymoney\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-n\fR] [\fB\-\-timers\fR\fI column\fR] [\fB\-\-nocatch\fR] [\fB\-\-trace\fR] [\fB\fIfile\fR\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
KMyMoney
is the Personal Finance Manager by
KDE\&. It provides the functions required to balance your checkbooks, manage your personal loans and categories your incomes and expenses using a checkbook style graphical user interface\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-\-lang\fR
.RS 4
Language to be used
.RE
.PP
\fB\-n\fR
.RS 4
Do not open last used file
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-timers\fR
.RS 4
Enable performance timers
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-nocatch\fR
.RS 4
Do not globally catch uncaught exceptions
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-trace\fR
.RS 4
Turn on program traces\&. This option is only available when
KMyMoney
is compiled in debug mode\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-dump\-actions\fR
.RS 4
Dump the names of all defined QAction objects to stdout and quit\&. This option is only available when
KMyMoney
is compiled in debug mode\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.RS 4

  The full documentation for KMyMoney is maintained as a docbook manual\&.  If the
  KHelpCenter program is properly installed at your site, the command \fB
  \fR\fB\fBkhelpcenter\fR\fR\fB \fR\fB\fIhelp:/kmymoney\fR\fR\fB \fR
  should give you access to the complete manual\&.  Alternatively the manual can be
  browsed in Konqueror giving it the URL \m[blue]\fBhelp:/kmymoney\fR\m[]
.RE
.RS 4
kf5options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
qt5options(7)
.RE
